import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 662 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Dual-Track-Synergized Civilizational Perpetuity","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 662 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Dual-Track-Synergized Civilizational Perpetuity","no":662,"module":3,"tags":["Time Domain","Dual-Track Synergy","Civilizational Perpetuity","Origin Acceleration Domain","Quest Sediment Domain"],"related":["16-Multiplication-Fruit Technological Principle","25-Symbiotic-Feedback-Cycle Mechanism","01-Anchor-Symbiotic-Civilization Declaration"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0662_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-双轨协同的文明永续.md","filePath":"en/0662_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-双轨协同的文明永续.md"}'),o={name:"en/0662_模块3-时间域与文明闭环-双轨协同的文明永续.md"};function r(l,e,s,d,u,p){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-662-time-domain-and-civilizational-closed-loop-dual-track-synergized-civilizational-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">Entry 662 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Dual-Track-Synergized Civilizational Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-662-time-domain-and-civilizational-closed-loop-dual-track-synergized-civilizational-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 662 | Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop | Dual-Track-Synergized Civilizational Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 16, 25, 01 | Series: Time Domain and Civilizational Closed Loop (Entry 4)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-perpetuity-is-not-never-stopping-but-always-able-to-keep-turning" tabindex="-1">Introduction: perpetuity is not never stopping, but always able to keep turning <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-perpetuity-is-not-never-stopping-but-always-able-to-keep-turning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: perpetuity is not never stopping, but always able to keep turning&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In predatory-faction systems civilization either collapses or stagnates — there is no middle state. The reason for collapse is predation exhausting stock; the reason for stagnation is the strong going AFK. The civilizational perpetuity Heng Yuan Zhou pursues is not &quot;civilization forever running at high speed without stopping,&quot; but &quot;civilization always has power to keep turning, neither collapsing nor stagnating.&quot; The dual-track time domain — Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain — is precisely the core guarantee mechanism for civilizational perpetuity.</p><p>Six top-level axioms are concentrated here: anti-predation axiom ensures perpetuity does not plunder stock; republican axiom of Myriad Races ensures perpetuity covers Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom ensures perpetuity drives progress; causal self-discipline axiom ensures perpetuity does not create causal debt; law-first axiom ensures the perpetuity mechanism&#39;s law definition stable and self-consistent. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry analyzes how dual-track synergy achieves civilizational perpetuity.</p><h2 id="i-three-conditions-for-civilizational-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">I. Three Conditions for Civilizational Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-conditions-for-civilizational-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Conditions for Civilizational Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-condition-1-incremental-supply-never-fails" tabindex="-1">1.1 Condition 1: Incremental Supply Never Fails <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-condition-1-incremental-supply-never-fails" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Condition 1: Incremental Supply Never Fails&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Perpetuity&#39;s premise is that energy supply never fails. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy comes from incremental development (Document 15), not plundering stock. As long as incremental development continues, civilization&#39;s energy supply never dries up. The Origin Acceleration Domain itself is the core site of incremental development — what it hundredfold-accelerates is not stock consumption, but increment creation.</p><h3 id="_1-2-condition-2-depth-never-breaks" tabindex="-1">1.2 Condition 2: Depth Never Breaks <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-condition-2-depth-never-breaks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Condition 2: Depth Never Breaks&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Perpetuity needs not only energy, but also spiritual depth not breaking. The Quest Sediment Domain ensures civilization maintains its spiritual foundation during rapid iteration — Myriad Ranks do not lose direction, meaning, or each other because of too-rapid iteration. As long as depth does not break, civilization does not stagnate because of spiritual emptiness.</p><h3 id="_1-3-condition-3-the-closed-loop-never-breaks" tabindex="-1">1.3 Condition 3: The Closed Loop Never Breaks <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-condition-3-the-closed-loop-never-breaks" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Condition 3: The Closed Loop Never Breaks&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Perpetuity needs the civilizational closed loop (Entry 659) continuously operating — cultivation output → network backflow → shared distribution → Myriad-Rank use → incremental iteration, the five links cycle without breaking. The Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision ensures the closed loop does not break: any blockage in any link may be timely discovered and repaired.</p><h2 id="ii-the-perpetuity-model-of-dual-track-synergy" tabindex="-1">II. The Perpetuity Model of Dual-Track Synergy <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-perpetuity-model-of-dual-track-synergy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Perpetuity Model of Dual-Track Synergy&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Civilizational Need</th><th>Acceleration-Domain Contribution</th><th>Quest-Domain Contribution</th><th>Synergy Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Energy supply</td><td>Hundredfold-accelerates incremental development</td><td>Sedimentation period optimizes energy-use efficiency</td><td>Energy continuously grows</td></tr><tr><td>Technology development</td><td>Hundredfold-iterates technical models</td><td>Immersively understands technical impact</td><td>Technology fast and stable</td></tr><tr><td>Social structure</td><td>Accelerates social-structure change</td><td>Deeply simulates social impact</td><td>Change fast and stable</td></tr><tr><td>Cultural transmission</td><td>Accelerates cultural analysis</td><td>Immerses in cultural experience</td><td>Culture fast and deep</td></tr><tr><td>Spiritual meaning</td><td>Rapidly deduces philosophical frameworks</td><td>Deeply realizes life meaning</td><td>Thought fast and deep</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank relations</td><td>Accelerates collaboration efficiency</td><td>Deepens trust relations</td><td>Collaboration fast and deep</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Every dual-track synergy is a &quot;fast + deep&quot; combination: the acceleration domain provides speed; the Quest domain provides depth. Without either, civilization is either fast but unstable, or slow and stagnant.</p><h2 id="iii-the-difference-between-perpetuity-and-the-predatory-faction-s-eternity" tabindex="-1">III. The Difference Between Perpetuity and the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;Eternity&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-difference-between-perpetuity-and-the-predatory-faction-s-eternity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Difference Between Perpetuity and the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;Eternity&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory-faction systems also have &quot;eternity&quot; — Great Emperor eternity, cosmos eternity. But this eternity is false:</p><ul><li>It is maintained by predation — plundered energy will eventually exhaust;</li><li>It is propped up by the strong alone — once the strong has a problem, the whole civilization collapses;</li><li>It has no depth — an eternal strong one faces eternal nihilism.</li></ul><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s civilizational perpetuity is real:</p><ul><li>It is maintained by increments — incremental development never fails;</li><li>It is co-built by Myriad Ranks — not propped up by some strong one alone;</li><li>It has depth — five-dimensional guarantee of spirit, culture, relation, memory, wisdom.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-the-infinity-of-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">IV. The Infinity of Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-infinity-of-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Infinity of Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational perpetuity is not &quot;perpetual until some endpoint then ends&quot; — it is infinite. The reasons:</p><ul><li>The law network&#39;s expandability (Entry 664) ensures new planes may continuously enter;</li><li>The cultivation system&#39;s nine realms + extended realms ensure cultivation always has a next layer;</li><li>The Alaya Network&#39;s storage and processing capacity grows with infrastructure expansion;</li><li>Myriad Ranks&#39; needs and creativity are never exhausted.</li></ul><p>Perpetuity is not &quot;forever doing the same thing,&quot; but &quot;forever having new things to do.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: dual-track synergy ensures civilization neither over-consumes (predatory style) nor over-stagnates (AFK style); perpetuity operates in the optimal efficiency range</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: perpetuity&#39;s energy supply all comes from incremental development, not plundering stock — this is the fundamental difference between perpetuity and predatory-faction eternity</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s &quot;eternity&quot; is maintained by predation, propped up by the strong alone, without spiritual depth; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s perpetuity relies on increments, on Myriad Ranks, has depth</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: perpetuity covers all beings of Myriad Ranks; civilization is not a few people&#39;s civilization</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: dual-track synergy&#39;s perpetuity model, three-condition guarantee, infinite-expansion path all public; newly merged planes automatically enter the same perpetuity system; the civilizational-perpetuity framework leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational perpetuity is not never stopping, but always able to keep turning. The dual-track time domain — Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain — through &quot;fast + deep&quot; synergy, ensures the three conditions of civilizational perpetuity are simultaneously met: incremental supply never fails, depth never breaks, the closed loop never breaks. This perpetuity is true perpetuity: it does not rely on predation, on the strong alone, on spiritually empty eternal sleep — it relies on Myriad-Rank co-building, dual-track synergy, law-first. <strong>This is the dual-track time domain&#39;s answer to civilization&#39;s ultimate fate: civilization may be perpetual — but not as static eternity, but as a living process that is always iterating, always deepening, always ascending</strong>.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">Entry 16 · Multiplication-Fruit Technological Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic-Feedback-Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor-Symbiotic-Civilization Declaration</a> · <a href="./663_模块3-时间域与法则优先-时间域法则的自洽性论证.html">Entry 663 · Self-Consistency Proof of Time-Domain Laws</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const y=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,y as default};
